OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 25 APR
OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GNeed to slow things down?
OL,6,     GAfrodeutsche brings the mellow
OL,7,     GSaturday flow you need to really
OL,8,     Ghit that deeply relaxing vibe.
OL,9,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,10,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,11,     Gof great music and chat, plus
OL,12,     GSuper Furry Animals' frontman
OL,13,     GGruff Rhys shares his 'First,
OL,14,     GLast and Everything' and chats
OL,15,     Gabout the band's new tour.
OL,16,G1000FThe Beth Ditto Show
OL,17,     GBeth is back for Saturday with
OL,18,     Gher favourite jams, special
OL,19,     Ganecdotes and more.
